@startuml
actor "用户" as User

boundary "Markdown 编  辑器界面" as MdEditorUI
boundary "时间轴界面" as TimelineUI

control "快照控制器" as SnapshotController

entity "文档实体" as DocumentEntity
entity "快照实体" as SnapshotEntity

== 自动快照保存 ==
MdEditorUI -> SnapshotController : 通知内容变更(docId)
SnapshotController -> DocumentEntity : 加载文档(docId)
SnapshotController -> SnapshotEntity : 差异或完整快照(document)
SnapshotController -> SnapshotEntity : 保存到磁盘()

== 用户回滚 ==
User -> TimelineUI : 打开时间轴
TimelineUI -> SnapshotController : 列出快照(docId)
SnapshotController -> SnapshotEntity : 加载快照列表()
SnapshotController -> TimelineUI : 显示列表()

User -> TimelineUI : 选择快照(snapshotId)
TimelineUI -> SnapshotController : 回滚(snapshotId)

SnapshotController -> SnapshotEntity : 加载(snapshotId)
SnapshotEntity --> SnapshotController : 快照内容
SnapshotController -> DocumentEntity : 覆盖写入(snapshotContent)
SnapshotController -> MdEditorUI : 刷新编辑器(document)
@enduml